Package: npmatch
Title: Probabilistic Record Linkage of Nonprofit Data to the IRS Business Master File
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for building crosswalks between arbitrary nonprofit datasets
    (entity name plus variable geographic detail) and the IRS Business Master
    File (BMF) of exempt organizations. Wraps reclin2 for blocked pairing and
    comparison, and adds nonprofit-specific normalization, a hard "do-not-match"
    veto engine, geography-adaptive weighting, and tiered (YES / MAYBE / NO)
    sorting with a structured hand-off for human or LLM refinement.
